# prompts/rag/.gitkeep
# ---------------------
# Retrieval-Augmented Generation prompt templates will be stored here.
# These templates combine the user query with retrieved document chunks
# and instruct the LLM to answer strictly from the provided context.
# Example files (future phases):
#   - rag_qa.txt               (standard RAG question-answer template)
#   - rag_qa_with_citations.txt (variant that requires source citations)
#   - rag_multi_hop.txt         (multi-step reasoning over multiple chunks)
